 StyleBox["NOT FOR PUBLICATION TO WOLFRAM COMMUNITY",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9798282476706247`*^9, 
  3.9798282824743547`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e8db9481-3cd4-4ad5-80d5-\
3aa4609ccce2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
TODO 1: Documentation of what a formal symbol is, what an extended formal \
symbols is, why we need them in the Relativity Toolkit, how we plan to update \
and test the Relativity Toolkit to be less ad-hoc and more disciplined with \
formal symbols and extended formal symbols, and why we need all the rest of \
this machinery (because Wolfram doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t provide a \
FormalSymbolQ and because we need extended formal symbols in our physics \
notebooks).\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979835212112277*^9, 3.9798352787828503`*^9}, {
  3.979835916935122*^9, 3.979835977599821*^9}, {3.979846538810094*^9, 
  3.979846539410631*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4a9dd0d-c7da-4e9e-9739-\
e72937609138"],

