8253510cc1bb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Expect a Pure System Symbol because the constructor ",
 StyleBox["CreateExtendedFormal", "Input"],
 " is idempotent: it recognizes that the input \[FormalM] is already a valid, \
built-in System symbol and returns it unchanged."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979859325807642*^9, 3.979859336370516*^9}, {
